   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## H3 image edit — CUDA (int8_convrot)\n\n1. **Load your images** in Reference 1 (the scene) and Reference 2 (the asset). More references: connect a LoadImage to the next free `ref_image_N` slot on the H3 node (up to 5).\n2. **Write the instruction.** Refer to images as `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`. Shape: `Task: Reference-guided generation.` → what each picture supplies (and does NOT supply) → the edit, with \"exactly one\" → what must stay.\n3. **Output size**: match the scene's aspect. 4 MP makes small lettering legible; one-shot tops out near 16.9 MP.\n4. **Queue.** Base model, euler/simple, 20 steps. Result lands in `output/h3_edit/`.\n\nNeeds: ComfyUI ≥ 0.30 with the MiniMax H3 nodes and comfy-kitchen ≥ 0.2.26, and from the Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3 repack: `minimax_h3_fl2va_int8_convrot` (diffusion_models), `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot` (text_encoders), `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16` + `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32` (vae). Tested on Blackwell (driver ≥ 580).\n\nLeave group 3 alone. `length` must stay 1 — that is what makes the video model render a still."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## H3 image edit — CUDA (int8_convrot)\n\n1. **Load your images** in Reference 1 (the scene) and Reference 2 (the asset). More references: connect a LoadImage to the next free `ref_image_N` slot on the H3 node (up to 5).\n2. **Write the instruction.** Refer to images as `<Picture 1>`, `<Picture 2>`. Shape: `Task: Reference-guided generation.` → what each picture supplies (and does NOT supply) → the edit, with \"exactly one\" → what must stay.\n3. **Output size**: match the scene's aspect. 4 MP makes small lettering legible; one-shot tops out near 16.9 MP.\n4. **Queue.** Base model, euler/simple, 20 steps. Result lands in `output/h3_edit/`.\n\nNeeds: ComfyUI ≥ 0.30 with the MiniMax H3 nodes and comfy-kitchen ≥ 0.2.26, and from the Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3 repack: `minimax_h3_fl2va_int8_convrot` (diffusion_models), `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot` (text_encoders), `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16` + `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32` (vae). Tested on Blackwell (driver ≥ 580).\n\nLeave group 3 alone. `length` must stay 1 — that is what makes the video model render a still."
